Templating Dashboards in Grafana
Lab Objectives
By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

Understand the concept of dashboard templating in Grafana
Create and configure template variables for dynamic dashboards
Implement query variables, custom variables, and constant variables
Build user-driven filters using dropdown menus and multi-select options
Create flexible dashboards that adapt based on user selections
Apply templating best practices for scalable dashboard design
Prerequisites
Before starting this lab, you should have:

Basic understanding of Linux command line operations
Familiarity with Grafana dashboard creation and panel configuration
Knowledge of PromQL (Prometheus Query Language) basics
Understanding of time series data concepts
Experience with basic system monitoring concepts
