Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Variables Not Loading
Problem: Template variables show "No data" or don't load options

Solution:

Check Prometheus connectivity: curl http://localhost:9090/api/v1/targets
Verify query syntax in Prometheus UI
Check data source configuration in Grafana
Ensure proper label names in queries
Issue 2: Panels Not Updating
Problem: Panels don't refresh when variables change

Solution:

Verify variable names match exactly in queries (case-sensitive)
Check variable syntax: $variable or ${variable}
Ensure proper regex patterns in variable configuration
Refresh the dashboard manually
Issue 3: Performance Issues
Problem: Dashboard loads slowly with many variables

Solution:

Optimize variable queries with specific filters
Reduce the number of concurrent queries
Use appropriate time ranges
Enable query result caching
Issue 4: Multi-Select Not Working
Problem: Multi-select variables don't filter correctly

Solution:

Use regex operator =~ instead of = in queries
Ensure "Include All option" is properly configured
Check "Custom all value" setting (usually .*)
Verify query syntax supports multiple values
