Conclusion
In this comprehensive lab, you have successfully learned how to create dynamic, templated dashboards in Grafana. You accomplished the following key objectives:

Technical Skills Developed:

Created and configured multiple types of template variables (Query, Custom, Constant, Textbox, Interval)
Implemented variable dependencies and chaining for dynamic filtering
Built user-driven filters with dropdown menus and multi-select options
Developed flexible dashboard panels that adapt based on user selections
